{"id":"e85e168ce8db5c81","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison.md","title":"迭代递增、相容与前不动点比较","display":"lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison — 迭代递增、相容与前不动点比较","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison","aliases":["72-lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison"],"display":"lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison — 迭代递增、相容与前不动点比较","depends_on":["[[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]"],"chapter":"X","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.X §4.2 and Ch.IX §3.3, print759–760,653–654/PDF771–772,665–666; local induction","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revised":"2026-10-22","revision_2026_10_22":"本轮新增节点保守记录为尚未完成完整依赖资格认证"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison — 迭代递增、相容与前不动点比较"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5d95b8963194821b\" href=\"?note=5d95b8963194821b\" title=\"72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration\">72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"X"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.X §4.2 and Ch.IX §3.3, print759–760,653–654/PDF771–772,665–666; local induction"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local proof recorded and manually reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"本轮新增节点保守记录为尚未完成完整依赖资格认证"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\preceq,b,F,\\theta\">\\(D,\\preceq,b,F,\\theta\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J_{F,\\theta}\">\\(J_{F,\\theta}\\)</span> 同 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d95b8963194821b\" href=\"?note=5d95b8963194821b\" title=\"72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration\">72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\\le\\theta\">\\(\\eta\\le\\theta\\)</span> 为序数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in D\">\\(z\\in D\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall\\alpha\\le\\beta\\le\\theta\\quad&amp;J_{F,\\theta}(\\alpha)\\preceq J_{F,\\theta}(\\beta),\\\\\nJ_{F,\\theta}\\restriction(\\eta+1)&amp;=J_{F,\\eta},\\\\\nF(z)\\preceq z\\quad&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\forall\\alpha\\le\\theta\\ (J_{F,\\theta}(\\alpha)\\preceq z).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall\\alpha\\le\\beta\\le\\theta\\quad&amp;J_{F,\\theta}(\\alpha)\\preceq J_{F,\\theta}(\\beta),\\\\\nJ_{F,\\theta}\\restriction(\\eta+1)&amp;=J_{F,\\eta},\\\\\nF(z)\\preceq z\\quad&amp;\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\forall\\alpha\\le\\theta\\ (J_{F,\\theta}(\\alpha)\\preceq z).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>构造时的同时归纳已给相邻阶段递增；极限取上确界，把相邻比较延伸到任意两阶段。限制函数满足同一个较短递归，由唯一性得到相容性。最后对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 归纳：零阶段底小于等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>；后继由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(J(\\alpha))\\preceq F(z)\\preceq z\">\\(F(J(\\alpha))\\preceq F(z)\\preceq z\\)</span>；极限由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span> 是全部先前阶段的上界。比较使用前不动点条件，强于只和不动点比较。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"5d95b8963194821b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration","status":"resolved","id":"5d95b8963194821b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$D,\\preceq,b,F,\\theta$ 与 $J_{F,\\theta}$ 同 [[72-df-transfinite-monotone-iteration]]；$\\eta\\le\\theta$ 为序数，$z\\in D$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"D,\\preceq,b,F,\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"J_{F,\\theta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta\\le\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"z\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\forall\\alpha\\le\\beta\\le\\theta\\quad&J_{F,\\theta}(\\alpha)\\preceq J_{F,\\theta}(\\beta),\\\\\nJ_{F,\\theta}\\restriction(\\eta+1)&=J_{F,\\eta},\\\\\nF(z)\\preceq z\\quad&\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\forall\\alpha\\le\\theta\\ (J_{F,\\theta}(\\alpha)\\preceq z).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"F(J(\\alpha))\\preceq F(z)\\preceq z","display":false},{"tex":"z","display":false}],"bytes":1788,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-427","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison|lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison — 迭代递增、相容与前不动点比较]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-448","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-461","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison|lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison — 迭代递增、相容与前不动点比较]]"},{"id":"48f27dd0a6718192","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1281b74b358815ce","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-413","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-lem-transfinite-iteration-comparison]]"}],"outgoing":["5d95b8963194821b"]}